---
+ A before B, A 在 B 之前
  ```text
  I eat before I work.  # 我在工作之前吃吃饭
  ```
+ A after B, A 在 B 之后
  ```text
  I eat after I work.   # 我工作完在吃饭
  ```
+ for me, 某件事对我有什么影响/是否合适我(强调对我来说)
  ```text
  English is difficult for me.  # 对我来说，英语很困难
  This task is easy for me.     # 对我来说，这个任务很轻松
  ```
+ to me, 我对某件事有什么看法/有什么感觉(固定词汇 + to someone)
  ```text
  is important to me.          
  is unfamiliar to me.
  is interesting to me.
  is familiar to me.
  is strange to me.
  ```
+ to + 动词原型, 为了......(同 in order to + 动词原型)
  ```text
  to make life better.            # 为了让生活更好
  in order to learn English.      # 为了学习英语
  to protect the painting.        # 为了保护一幅画
  ```
+ when A, B, 当 A 发生后, B 再发生
  ```text
  I was surprised when I saw her.   # 我看到她时，我很惊讶
  When I saw her, I was surprised.  # 我看到她时，我很惊讶
  ```